===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Battle Styles|Salazzle|28}} from the {{TCG|Battle Styles}} expansion.
*'''Combustion''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Destiny|Slugma|82}} from {{TCG|Neo Destiny}}.
